and accurate algorithm to estimate large phylogenies by maximum likelihood</article-title><source>Syst Biol</source><year>2003</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>696</fpage><lpage>704</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14530136</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/10635150390235520</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>La Scola</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Raoult</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Survival of Coxiella burnetii within free-living amoeba Acanthamoeba castellanii</article-title><source>Clin Microbiol Infect</source><year>2001</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>75</fpage><lpage>79</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11298146</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1469-0691.2001.00193.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cho</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Stapels</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Morris</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Vergin</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwalbach</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Givan</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Polyphyletic photosynthetic reaction centre genes in oligotrophic marine Gammaproteobacteria</article-title><source>Environ Microbiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>1456</fpage><lpage>1463</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17504483</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1462-2920.2007.01264.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Iizuka</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Jojima</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><s